## Vue 3 + TypeScript Coding Standard

When writing Vue components:

- Always use `<script setup lang="ts">` with TypeScript.
- Organize code inside `<script setup>` in this order:
  1. Imports
  2. Type definitions / defineProps
  3. defineEmits
  4. Reactive refs
  5. Computed properties
  6. Methods
  7. Lifecycle hooks

- Use `<style scoped lang="scss">` for component styles.
- Avoid global styles unless explicitly needed.

